  { id: 9, surahNumber: 103, ayahNumber: 2, arabic: "إِنَّ الْإِنْسَانَ لَفِي خُسْرٍ", transliteration: "Innal insana lafi khusr", english: "Indeed, mankind is in loss,", tafheem: "This is a powerful declaration. Every human being is in a state of loss unless they use their time wisely in the worship of Allah. Without faith and righteous deeds, life passes in vain." },
  { id: 10, surahNumber: 103, ayahNumber: 3, arabic: "إِلَّا الَّذِينَ آمَنُوا وَعَمِلُوا الصَّالِحَاتِ وَتَوَاصَوْا بِالْحَقِّ وَتَوَاصَوْا بِالصَّبْرِ", transliteration: "Illalladhina amanu wa 'amilus-salihati wa tawasaw bil-haqqi wa tawasaw bis-sabr", english: "Except for those who have believed and done righteous deeds and advised each other to truth and advised each other to patience.", tafheem: "The only way to escape loss is through four things: faith (Iman), righteous actions, mutual exhortation to truth, and patience. Tafheem beautifully explains this as the complete recipe for success in this world and the Hereafter." },

