  { id: 12, surahNumber: 112, ayahNumber: 2, arabic: "اللَّهُ الصَّمَدُ", transliteration: "Allahu s-Samad", english: "Allah, the Eternal Refuge.", tafheem: "Allah is Self-Sufficient. He needs nothing and everything depends on Him. The Tafheem explains that Allah is the one to whom all creation turns in times of need." },
