  { id: 45, surahNumber: 55, ayahNumber: 2, arabic: "عَلَّمَ الْقُرْآنَ", transliteration: "Allamal Qur'an", english: "Taught the Qur'an,", tafheem: "The greatest favor of Ar-Rahman is teaching the Qur'an. It is the ultimate guidance and mercy for humanity." },
